  -- approach: de Weger's collision conjecture as the one hypothesis (the route of MRSTT 2022, Remark 1.5): every middle row of a is a row of a sporadic collision or Lind-adjacent to every other, so K = 1, B = 17
  -- licence: CC-BY-4.0
